<title>SPAIN: Buba's Schieber says Spain made admirable progress.</title>
<headline>Buba's Schieber says Spain made admirable progress.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank council member Helmut Schieber said on Monday that Spain had made great and admirable progress toward convergence.</p>
<p>&quot;Your country, Spain, and also Portugal and Italy, clearly show the greatest enthusiasm for European monetary union and particularly your country has made great and admirable progress toward convergence,&quot; Schieber said at a seminar in Madrid.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
